From 920fe9eea864de5c8c1a38038b159469ef76e528 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rob Paprocki <hi@rpaprocki.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 01:01:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 10/28] deploy: native runtime for Alpine 3.24 (OpenRC) and
 Debian 13 (systemd), no Docker

- deploy/gunicorn.conf.py: 1 worker, 2 gthreads, on 127.0.0.1:8000
  (RDGEN_BIND can be set in the env file). Upstream's file (5x6 on
  0.0.0.0) is for the Docker image. gunicorn 25's $HOME control socket is
  turned off.
- deploy/openrc/{rdgen,rdgen-poller}: supervise-daemon (respawn),
  command_user rdgen, directory /var/lib/rdgen, rc_ulimit -n 65535,
  umask 027, logs in /var/log/rdgen. The venv is --system-site-packages
  (the distro provides Django/Pillow/gunicorn/requests/pycryptodomex/
  PyNaCl), so it has no bin/gunicorn: the service runs
  `.venv/bin/python3 -m gunicorn`.
- deploy/systemd/{rdgen,rdgen-poller}.service: same, plus
  ProtectSystem=strict, ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/rdgen, NoNewPrivileges,
  PrivateTmp, MemoryMax.
- Only RDGEN_ENV_FILE is set in the unit. Secrets stay in
  /etc/rdgen/rdgen.env (root:rdgen 0640), are read by Django, and do not
  appear in the process environment.
- deploy/nginx/rdgen-lan.conf: own LAN-only port 8190 (RFC1918/ULA
  allow-list, 10 MB bodies, login rate limit). This is the recommended
  target for CortenDesk's "Build Installers" link.
- deploy/nginx/rdgen-subpath.conf: alternative /rdgen/ location for an
  existing server block, with RDGEN_URL_PREFIX=/rdgen.
- deploy/rdgen.env.example: every setting with its default.
- deploy/requirements-venv.txt: pyzipper 0.4.0 with hashes (the only
  package not in Alpine 3.24 or Debian 13), installed with --no-deps
  --require-hashes.

Tested in an Alpine 3.24.2 minirootfs (rootless namespace, so the rdgen
uid switch itself was not exercised): apk python3 3.14.7, py3-django
5.2.17, py3-pillow 12.2.0, py3-gunicorn 25.2.0, py3-requests 2.33.1,
py3-pycryptodomex 3.23.0, py3-pynacl 1.6.2, nginx 1.30.4. Both nginx
layouts serve login, CSRF, redirects and cookies correctly. The web
worker and poller run against a GitHub stub. RSS: gunicorn master 18 MB,
worker 57 MB, poller 57 MB.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
